WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:01.500
- Speaking of Miley.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.520
This was one of my favorite
things I've heard recently.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.130
So she shared her experience with UFO's,

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:08.810
which I do believe life is out there,

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:11.000
but you've had a similar experience.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.189
I didn't know that.

00:00:12.189 --> 00:00:15.320
- (laughing) Well I don't
talk about it all that often

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.440
to be honest, but you know,

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.430
it goes back, when I was a little boy

00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:21.350
growing up in Kentucky,
there was this place

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:22.183
back in the mountains,

00:00:22.183 --> 00:00:25.360
and there's these big old
beach trees back there.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.680
And beach trees are good
to carve on with a knife

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.539
and way back in the 1930s,

00:00:30.539 --> 00:00:33.108
a guy that lived back in the mountains

00:00:33.108 --> 00:00:35.770
had had this experience with,

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:38.480
he carved the pictures on a tree.

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.080
I found them when I was a little boy

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:43.140
and it was an old model
T Ford and a saucer

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.657
and this alien looking thing.

00:00:44.657 --> 00:00:47.020
And I started researching
and I go, wait man,

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:50.160
there was like an alien
invasion in Kentucky

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.323
in the late 1930's, who knew about that.

00:00:52.323 --> 00:00:53.243
- Why not?

00:00:53.243 --> 00:00:55.410
- Yeah, and so I kind
of got, I don't know,

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:57.130
fascinated with it as a little boy.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:59.840
And then a couple of times,

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:02.372
you know, throughout life
I've seen some crazy stuff.

00:01:02.372 --> 00:01:06.480
Some of it I'm sure most of
it's probably explainable,

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:07.890
but some of it, I liked-

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:09.560
Hey, I took that picture.

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:12.423
- [Kelly] He said, hey. (laughing)

00:01:13.723 --> 00:01:16.680
- I remember that one right
there, that's a beauty.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.180
I took that.

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.380
With my Blackberry.

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:23.280
- With my Blackberry, iPhone. (laughing)

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:24.420
So wait, Rainn and Lisa do y'all believe?

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.730
Lisa, do you believe in extraterrestrial?

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.190
- I do, I do.

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.342
- I don't think it's what we think it is.

00:01:29.342 --> 00:01:30.175
- I know.

00:01:30.175 --> 00:01:31.300
- But I do believe in like other life.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.860
- I think that just can't,
we can't be the only life.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.053
- [Kelly] I think that's so
egocentric to think that.

00:01:35.053 --> 00:01:36.130
- I think so, too.

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:37.680
- Right, I mean unless
you don't believe in it

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.053
and then I think that's fine Rainn.

00:01:39.053 --> 00:01:41.312
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:41.312 --> 00:01:44.750
- Oh no, I totally believe that there's,

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:47.700
there's aliens and some
kind of they'd be traveling

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:50.020
and they'd be observing us, and right now

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.040
I think those aliens are
looking down on planet earth

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:52.873
and going.

00:01:54.341 --> 00:01:55.221
- [Lisa] Yes.

00:01:55.221 --> 00:01:56.933
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:56.933 --> 00:01:57.766
- [Lisa] I would agree.

00:01:57.766 --> 00:02:00.103
- They're behind the curve,
they just can't figure it out.

